<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Dondo Congo</book>
  <para style="ide">LOMA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda Loma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Loma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lom</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wu Pawuli ku bisi-</para>
  <para style="mt1">Loma</para>
  <para style="imt">Kibila ki kasonikina buuku bedidi</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda wusonika Pawuli ku minkwikidi mii Loma. Kayenda kwe longila ko, kansi muntu wuhiika wuyenda longa bantu bakwe zakidilanga koko, mpe wuzakisa kizingu ki bantu mu Klisto. Pawuli wubasonikina mwanki bazaba nani kadi. Ni hahoho, kabateedila ti bu naakwenda ku nsi Esipani, mbo nahyokila yo mu syamisa bantu mu nzila yi Klisto. Wubalomba mpe bamusambidila mwanki kabaka hwahwa dye kwe bavunga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawuli wubalonka mu mukanda bewuwu musamu wuvudi wumbote mu kiminu mu Klisto. Wuta ti bantu bamvimba basumukini mpe basidi na nkembo wu Nzambi ko. Kansi bwabu, balendi wawasana nandi mu nzila yi kintwadi na Yesu-Klisto. Nzambi wusoola Pawuli mu ba ntumwa mwanki kalonga Musamu Wumbote. Pawuli wuta ti, Musamu Wumbote wudi lulendo lu Nzambi ku wonso muntu kwikidi. Kutandi ti ewu Muyudayo hoti wulembolo ba Muyudayo. Ku Nzambi, kunaani diswaswani ha kati di minkwidi mimvimba, kuu muntu hyokidi mu nandi ko. Wubabongila bonso bantu balunungu, bonso bu wudi wusonama. Bata ti: «Muntu wulunungu waazinga mu kiminu kyandi» Loma 1.17. Pawuli wuta dyaka ti minkwikidi mimvimba mifweti yuwasana, nakani muntu kalendi yina munandi ko, ka bedisandi munandi ko, ka fundisandi munandi ko, kati mbelo awu yii yimosi ko.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda bewuwu Pawuli wu kasonika ku bisi-Loma nkatika wumbote wudi, tuka kilumbu bekyokyo, minkwikidi mitambula wo bumbote.</para>
  <para style="iot">Tala bonso budi ndandani yi misamu mu buuku di sonika Pawuli:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Pawuli wusamuna Musamu Wumbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:1-7">1.1-7</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Bantu bamvimba basumukini (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:18-3:20">1.18–3.20</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Bwedi Nzambi kabongila bantu bonso bantu balunungu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 3:21-4:25">3.21–4.25</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Bantu ba Nzambi bana tambula luzingu lumona (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 5:1-8:39">5.1–8.39</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Nzambi wubwongola kanda di Isaeli, kansi ka kimankulu ko (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 9:1-11:36">9.1–11.36</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Luzingu lumona mu kati di luzolo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12.1–15.13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">7) Nzengolo zi bonga Pawuli na zimbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 15:14-16:27">15.14–16.27</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Meno Pawuli, kisadi ki Yesu-Klisto, wu katumisa mu ba ntumwa na wu kasoola mu samuna Musamu Wumbote wu Nzambi.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Musamu Wumbote bewowo, Nzambi wa kasiila nsilulu ku mimbikudi myandi tuka ntama mu nzila yi Masonama malongo, <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />mana zonzila Mwana andi, wubutuka bonso muntu, mu nkuna yi Davidi. <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Yondowo, Nzambi wu kasoola mu lulendo mu ba Mwana andi bu kamufulukisa mu bafwa mu nzila yi Mpeve Yilongo, ni Yesu-Klisto, Mfumu eto. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Mu yandi, natambula mulemvo mu sala kisalu ki buntumwa, mu twadisa mu nkumbu andi bantu ba nsi zimvimba, mwanki mu nzila yi kiminu, batumama. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Yeno mpe ludi mu kabu di bantu bebobo, Yesu-Klisto bakatumisa.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Meno nina sonika ku yeno bamvimba luu ku mbanza yi Loma, yobobo Nzambi bakatomini tya na bakatumisa mu ba bantu bandi. Bika Nzambi Tata dyeto na Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto kalusakumuna na kaluhaana kiyenge.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli na minsambidi mi mbanza yi Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Nina vutula ntete matondo ku Nzambi ani mu nkumbu Yesu-Klisto mu dyambu di yeno bamvimba, mu dyambu ti bantu bana zonzila kiminu kyeno mu nza yimvimba. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Nzambi yina kwe sadilanga mu mutima ani wumvimba, bu nakwe samunanga Musamu Wumbote wu Mwana andi, wudi mbangi ani ti nakwe lubambukilanga moyo. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Mu zinsambulu zani, nina tatamana mu lomba luzolo lu Nzambi, mwanki na baka hwahwa dye kwiza luvunga. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Mu dyambu ti nkatika mpwila yii naani mu luyena, mwanki yeno mpe lutambula munkayulu wu Mpeve Yilongo, mpe lusyama, <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />bwabobo bufwanakani niza ku yeno tusyamasana ha kimosi yeno na meno mu nzila yi kiminu kimosi yeno na meno.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulendo lu Nzambi mu Musamu Wumbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Mpangi zani, natiidi luzaba ti nakwe banga na mabanza me kwiza ku yeno, mwanki nayonzika mbutu ha kati dyeno bonso bu nayonzikila zo ku bantu bansi zihiika. Kansi nzila yikangama yidi natee mu kilumbu bekiki. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Nafweti sala kisalu kyani ku bantu bamvimba: balongoka na balembolo longoka, bandwenga mpe na balembolo ba na ndwenga. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ni hahoho, nabakidi mpwila ye mwangisa Musamu Wumbote ku yeno bisi-Loma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Nii na nsoni ko mu mwangisa Musamu Wumbote, mu dyambu ti wudi lulendo lu Nzambi mu vuukisa yondowo kwikidi, Muyudayo ntete, mboki lembolo ba Muyudayo. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Mu dyambu ti ni Musamu Wumbote wukwe lonkanga lunungu lu Nzambi mu nzila yi kiminu na mu kiminu kwandi bonso bu wudi wusonama ti: «Muntu wulunungu waazinga mu kiminu.»<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfundusu yi Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Nzambi tuuka ku yulu kwe yenikisanga mankesi mandi ku bantu bakwe lembolo vuminanga luzolo lwandi mpe bakwe lembolo mu zitisanga. Mu nsadulu zawu zimbi, yawu bakwe fyetikisanga kikedika. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Kadi myo mitadidi Nzambi milendi zabakana ku yawu, mu dyambu ti Nzambi yandi bende wu bazabikisa myo. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Mu dyambu ti tuuka Nzambi bu kahidika nza, bu twayindula mavanga mandi, mavanga mandi makwe yenikisanga bumbote: nkadulu andi yilunga yikwe lembolo yenikanga, lulendo lwandi lu mimvu ka mimvu na bunzambi bwandi. Ni hahoho, bantu basidi dyaka na mpengomokono ko. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Mu dyambu ti bazebi Nzambi, kansi bakwe muzitisanga ko, mpe bamuzebi bonso Nzambi ko. Kansi, mayindu mawu ma buzengi ma kotisi mitima myawu mimbi mu kitombe. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Yawu bana kilonka ti bantu bandwenga badi, kansi byeka bilahuki. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Mpe bakitudi nkembo wu Nzambi wukwe lembolo bolanga mu kifwani ki muntu, ki zinuni, ki bibulu bii na malu maya na bibulu bikwe kwe syelomokingi ha butoto bikwe bolanga.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Ni hahoho, Nzambi kabayekodila mu mavanga mambi bonso budi nzinunu zi mitima myawu, mwanki basafula nitu zawu yawu na yawu. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Bakitudi kikedika ki Nzambi luvunu, bena zitisa na bena sadila kwawu bima bihidika Nzambi, na babisidi mu musambila yandi bende wuhidika byo, yandi fwanakani mu kemboso mimvu ka mimvu! Ameni!<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ni hahoho, Nzambi kabayekodila mu mpwila zinsoni: Bakento bawu bakwe bwesa vukisanga nitu awu na babakala bawu ko, kansi bana vuka mfulu yawu na yawu <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Bumosi mpe babakala bana bisa mu vuka mfulu na bakento bawu, kansi bafulukidi mu mpwila ze vukisa mfulu yawu na yawu, bakala na bakala, bana hidika misamu minsoni. Ni hahoho, baatambudila musendo mu nkadulu awu yimbi. <verse eid="ROM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Bu babisidi mu zaba Nzambi, Nzambi wubayekodi mu sadila madyela mawu matengama. Ni hahoho, bana sadila misamu milembolo fwanakana. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Basidi dyaka bantu balunungu ko, bafulukidi mu busafu, nzodyambongo, nzinunu, mbalu, bafulukidi mu kimpala, beka mimpondi, mayuma, luvunu, misamu mimvimba mimbi, kuhunina banawu misamu, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />kutoola, beka mitantu mi Nzambi, bafuluka mu leho na mayama, kukitumpidika, bafulukidi mu ndwenga ze hidika misamu mimbi, kubisa mu tumimina bibuti, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />wulembolo ba na madyela, na mpisulu, mutima wukangama, na wulembolo ba na nkenda. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Mpeleko bazebi nzengolo yi Nzambi yina ta ti, yobobo bakwe sadilanga misamu mimbi bemyomyo, baafwa. Kansi mya bakwe hidikanga yawu bende, na bakwe tambulanga mpe yobobo bakwe hidikanga myo.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mfundusu yi kedika yi Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Buna ni wuba nani, ngeye kwe fundisanga bahiika, zaba ti wuu na ndemvokolo ko. Bu kwe fundisanga bahiika, kwe kibedisanga ngebende, mu dyambu ti ngeye kwe fundisanga, kwe dyatilanga bonso yawu. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Tuzebi ti Nzambi mu kedika kakwe fundisilanga bantu bakwe hidikanga misamu mibobobo. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Ngeye kwe fundisanga yobobo bakwe hidikanga myo bonso ngebende, wuna banzila ti ngeye waavuuka mu mfundusu yi Nzambi e? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Hoti wuna safula bunene bu mambote ma Nzambi, mvibudulu andi na mutima andi we yambudila, wuna lembana mu bakula ti mambote mandi mana kulomba wuvilula madyela e? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Kansi mu mutima ngolo aku na bu wuna bisa mu vilula madyela, wuna kwe yonziki ngebende kitumbu kihyokidi bunene mu kilumbu Nzambi ki kalonka mankesi mandi na lufundusu lukedika, <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />kilumbu bekyokyo ki kaahaana musendo ku kadi muntu bonso budi ndyatulu andi. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Mbo kahaana luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu ku yobobo bana tatamana mu sadila mambote na bana sosa nkembo, nzitusu na luzingu lukwe lembolo bolanga. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Kansi mbo kalonka mankesi mandi na nganzi zandi ku yobobo bakwe munangumukinanga, bakwe lembolo tambulanga kikedika na bakwe lembolo tumiminanga misamu milunungu. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Mpasi na manyongo byaakwamisa bantu bebobo bakwe hidikanga misamu mimbi, bantete Bayudayo mpe balembolo ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Nkembo, nzitusu na kiyenge ku yobobo bakwe sadilanga mambote, bantete Bayudayo mpe balembolo ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi kasanga diswaswani ha kati di bantu ko.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Bamvimba bebobo bakwe sanga masumu wulembolo zaba Misiku mu Mose, baafwa wulembolo zaba Misiku. Kansi, bamvimba bebobo bakwe sanga masumu bazebi Misiku, baafundusu bonso buna tumina Misiku. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Mu dyambu ti, kayobobo kaka ko bakwe yuwanga Misiku baaba bantu balunungu ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. Kaani, kansi yobobo bakwe sadilanga myo, baabatumisina bantu balunungu. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo na bazebi Misiku ko, kadi bana sadila myo, bana vumina Misiku mu luzolo lu yawu bende mpeleko bazebi myo ko. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Mpe bana lonka ti nsadulu yina lomba Misiku, yii yisonama mu mitima myawu. Mu dyambu ti, ndyatulu awu yina lonka kimbangi, mpe mayindu mawu malendi bafunda hoti malendi banwanina. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Mimvimba bemyomyo myaayenika mu kilumbu Nzambi ki kaafundisa, mu nkumbu Yesu-Klisto, mansweki ma luzingu lu kadi muntu, bonso bu wudi wusonama mu Musamu Wumbote wu nina kwe samuni.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isaeli bisidi mu tumama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Kansi, ngeye wuna kibika Muyudayo, kangamani mu Misiku mi Mose na kwe kitumpidikanga mu Nzambi, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />ngeye zebi luzolo lwandi, mpe Misiku mi kulonga mu soola misamu mimbote, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />ngeye wuna kilonka muntwadisi wu zimpofo, kya ki yobobo badi mu tombe, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />muntwadisi wu balembolo ba na madyela, mulongisi wu baala bafyoti, mu dyambu ti nzebi ti mu Misiku lenda baka nzayilu yilunga na kikedika. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Bwabu ngeye kwe longanga banaku, ngebende lendi kilongaka ko! Ngeye kwe longanga bantu babiika bwivi, kansi ngebende kwe yibanga! <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Wuna dika kinsuza, ngebende wuna sadila kinsuza! Ngeye kwe belanga biteki, kansi kwe yibanga bii mu zinzo zawu zi lusambulu! <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Ngeye wuna kitumpidika mu Misiku, kansi wuna vweza Nzambi bu wuna lembolo tumimina Misiku. <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Kedika, bonso bu wudi wusonama ti: «Mu dyambu dyeno nkumbu yi Nzambi yina safulu ku balembolo ba Bayudayo.»<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Kuzengoso bubakala kudi mfunu tala ti wuna tumama mu Misiku. Kansi tala ti wuna tyaka Misiku, weka bonso muntu lembolo zengoso bubakala. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Tala ti muntu lembolo zengoso bubakala wuna tumimina Misiku, nganunu Nzambi kalendi mu bongila bonso muntu zengoso bubakala ko e? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Yondowo lembolo zengoso bubakala, kansi wuna vumina Misiku, waakufundisa ngeye wuna lembolo tumimina Misiku, mpeleko wuu na Misiku misonama na wuzengoso bubakala. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Mu dyambu ti, Muyudayo wukedika ka ni yondowo ko kwe yenikanga, mpe kuzengoso bubakala ku kedika, ka ni kokoko kukwe yenikanga mu nitu ko, <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />kansi Muyudayo wukedika ni mu mwela andi. Mpe kuzengoso bubakala kukedika ni mu mutima andi. Kuzengoso bubakala bebobo ku Mpeve Yilongo kukwe fumanga, kansi ka mu Misiku misonama ko. Muyudayo wukedika, masiika ku Nzambi makwe fumanga, kansi ka ku bantu ko.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s">Nzambi wudi wukwikama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Buna nkye mfunu mu ba Muyudayo e? Nkye ndandu mu zengoso bubakala e? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Ndandu yiyinene mu nzila zizingi yidi. Mu dyambu ti, Mambu ma Nzambi masamunu ku Bayudayo, mwanki baaba bantete mu sadila mo. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Nkye dyambu tulendi ta, tala ti Bayudayo bahiika bakwikama mu Nzambi ko e? Bu balembolo ba bakwikama, nganunu Nzambi kaaba wukwikama ko e? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Kaani! Tufweti zaba ti Nzambi kedika kadi, kadi muntu wuu na luvunu, mu dyambu ti wudi wusonama ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">«Fweti zabakana muntu wulunungu mu mpova zaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">mwanki wununga tala ti bana kufunda.»<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Kansi tala ti mbi yi tukwe sanga yikwe lonkanga lunungu lu Nzambi, buna nki twaata e? Buna Nzambi kasiidi dyaka wulunungu ko, mu dyambu ti wuna tusemba mu mankesi. Nina zonzila bonso bantu baa mu nza. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Kaani! Tala ti bwabobo, nganunu bwedi Nzambi kalendi fundisila nza e?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Kansi, tala ti luvunu lwani luna toma yenikisa kikedika ki Nzambi na nkembo andi, bila nki ndendi bwesa fundusulu ku yandi bonso munsumuki e? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Bantu bahiika bana kwe tusafudi mu ta ti mpova zo zi luvunu zeto zidi. Bantu bebobo bana tufunda ti: «Bika tuhidika misamu mimbi mwanki mimbote mi duuka ha kati di misamu mimbi e?» Bantu bebobo baafundusu bonso bufwanakani.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kunaani muntu wulunungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Bwedi twaata e? Nganunu yeto Bayudayo tuhyokidi mfunu bantu bahiika e? Kaani! Mu dyambu ti, tulonka ti muntu ni kaba Muyudayo, ni kalembolo ba Muyudayo, bamvimba ku nsye kinanga ki masumu tudi. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Bonso buwusonama ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">«Kunaani muntu wulunungu, na kaani wumosi.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Ku naani muntu wuu na madyela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:11">ku naani muntu wuna sosa Nzambi.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Bantu bamvimba basisidi nzila yimbote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">kunaani muntu wuhidikidi kani musamu wumbote.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">Kunaani, kani wumosi!<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Muhudi awu wudi bonso ndyamu yimwasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Ludimi lwawu luna basadisa mu huna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Mu bikoba byawu muu na miswa mi nyoka.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Minwa myawu mifuluka mu misamu minsingulu na mindudi.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Malu mawu makwe nookanga ntiinu mu tengola menga.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Mu bifulu bimvimba mu bakwe hyokilanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:16">bakwe mwangisanga bima bimvimba mpe bakwe sisanga kyadi.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Bazebi nzila yi kiyenge ko.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Bakwe vuminanga Nzambi ko.»<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Tuzebi ti mimvimba mikwe tanga Misiku, mikwe teholongo ku yobobo bana zinga ku nsye lutumu lu Misiku. Mina sa ti nakaani muntu kazonzandi, na bantu babakula ti nza yimvimba yi bedoso yidi ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Ni hahoho, kunaani muntu waaba wulunungu ha ntadisi yi Nzambi bu kavumini Misiku. Mu dyambu ti Misiku mikwe lonkanga ku muntu ti masumu kasiidi.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi kwe vukisilanga bantu mu nzila yi kiminu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Kadi bwabu Nzambi wutulonkidi bwedi kakwe tusilanga muntu wulunungu ha ntadisi andi, wulembo ba ku nsye Misiku. Mpe mabuuku ma mimbikudi na ma Misiku mana muteela kimbangi. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Nzambi kwe sanga ti bantu baba balunungu mu kiminu kyawu mu Yesu-Klisto. Kwe sanga bo ku yobobo bakwe mukwikilanga, mu dyambu ti kunaani diswaswani ha kati dyawu. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Kadi bantu bamvimba basumukini mpe beka kitatu (basidi) na nkembo wu Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Kansi Nzambi wuba sidi bantu balunungu mu mulemvo andi wumpamba, mu nzila yi nkudulu mu Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Ha ntadisi yi bamvimba, Yandi Nzambi kahaana bonso munkayulu mu baka ndemvokolo yi masumu, mu nzila yi kiminu mu menga mandi. Wulonka lunungu lwandi bu kabika mu semba masumu mantama, mu ntangu yi mvibudulu andi. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Mu ntangu beyiyi, Nzambi lonkidi lunungu lwandi, mwanki bantu babakula ti kaba yandi bende muntu wulunungu. Wusa bobo, mwanki kakitula wulungu muntu wuna zingila mu kiminu mu Yesu. Kanungisa yondowo wuna zingila mu kiminu mu Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Bwabu kuu na musamu dyaka we kitumpidikila e? Kaani, kunaani! Bila nki e? Mu dyambu ti, kima kimfunu, ka muvumina musiku ko, kansi lukwikulu mu Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Tubakudi ti mu dyambu di kiminu muntu kadi wulunungu, kansi ka bu katumimini Misiku ko. Tuna banzila ti muntu kadi wulunungu ko bu katumimini Misiku, kansi tukwikidi mu dyambu di kiminu muntu kadi wulungu. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Hoti Nzambi wudi kaka Nzambi yi Bayudayo e? Nganunu kadi mpe Nzambi yi balembolo ba Bayudayo e? Ninga, wudi mpe Nzambi yi balembolo ba Bayudayo, <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />mu dyambu ti Nzambi yimosi kwandi yidi. Yandi waanungisa mu nzila yi kiminu, bazengoso bubakala na balembolo zengoso bubakala. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Mu nzila yi kiminu, nganunu tulendi katula mfunu yi Misiku e? Kaani! Misiku kisalu midi!<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Abalahami munkwikidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Nki bwabu tulendi ta mu Abalahami mukulu eto e? Nkye bima kabaka mu ngolo zi yandi bende e? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Tala ti Abalahami wuyenika bonso muntu wulunungu mu dyambu di mavanga mandi, wudi na luve mu kitumpidika, kansi kalendi bwesa ha ntadisi yi Nzambi ko! <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Bwabu, Masonama nki mana ta e? Abalahami wukwikila Nzambi na Nzambi wumubongila bonso muntu wulunungu mu dyambu di kiminu kyandi. <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Ni hahoho, yondowo sedi kwandi, mufutu andi babongila wo bonso munkayulu ko, kansi bonso musendo wu kafweti tambula. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Bwabu yondowo lembolo sala, kansi kwikidi mu yondowo kwe kitulanga muntu wumbi wulunungu, mu kiminu kyandi Nzambi wamubongila bonso muntu wulunungu. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Bwabobo mpe Davidi kana zonzila kyese ki muntu bewowo Nzambi wu kabongidi bonso wulunungu, kaati kasedyandi ko.<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />«Kyese ku yobobo balemvokolo mambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:7">na bakatudi masumu!<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Kyese ku muntu bewowo Mfumu wu kalembolo tangumuna masumu!»<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Kyese kibobobo kitadidi kwandi bazengoso bubakala, hoti mpe balembolo zengoso bubakala e? Ni hahoho tukwe teelanga ti: Nzambi wubongila Abalahami bonso muntu wulunungu mu dyambu di kiminu kyandi. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Kansi, mu nkye ntangu kamubongila muntu wulungu e? Ku manima Abalahami ma kazengoso bubakala hoti tekila kazengoso bo e? Kaani! Ka kulandila ko, kansi tekila kazengoso bubakala! <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Nzengosolo yi bubakala bu Abalahami yiba bonso kidimbu kina lonka ti Nzambi wumubongila muntu wulunungu mu dyambu di kiminu kyandi, buna kazengoso bubakala bwandi ko. Bwabobo kayiza bela ha kimosi tata di minkwikidi mimvimba milembolo zengoso bubakala, mwanki lunungu luyenika kuu yawu. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Yandi wudi mpe tata di yobobo bazengoso bubakala, mpila mosi ti yobobo bakwe bisanga mu tala kaka kuzengoso bubakala, kansi bakwe landanga bitambi bi kiminu ki tata eto Abalahami tekila kazengoso bubakala bwandi.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsilulu yi Nzambi yitambulu mu kiminu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Ka mu dyambu di Misiku ko, nsilulu ye tambula nza bonso fwa Nzambi yi kasiila ku Abalahami hoti ku nkuna andi, kansi mu nzila yi lunungu lukwe fumanga mu kiminu. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Tala ti mu dyambu di Misiku bantu bakwe byadilanga fwa, buna kiminu kisidi dyaka mfunu ko, mpe nsilulu yi Nzambi yeka yimpamba. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Mu dyambu ti Misiku mikwe tukisanga mankesi ma Nzambi. Huuma ha lembolo ba Misiku, habanga matingu ko.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Buna mu nzila yi kiminu tukwe tambudilanga fwa, mwanki wuba munkayulu wumpamba, mpe nkuna yimvimba yitambula nsilulu. Nsilulu yi lendi ba kaka ku yobobo bakwe vuminanga Misiku ko, kansi ku yobobo mpe bakwe kwikilanga bonso Abalahami. Abalahami wudi tata di yeto bamvimba. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Bonso bu wusonama: «Nakusidi tata di makanda mamingi.» Tata eto kadi ha ntadisi yi Nzambi yi kakwikila. Nzambi yikwe haananga luzingu ku bafwa na yikwe sanga ti bima bikwe lembolo zinganga, bibaka luzingu. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Abalahami wusa kivuvu, mpeleko kivuvu kihwa, kansi Abalahami wutatamana mu kwikila, bwabobo kayiza beela «tata di makanda mamingi», bonso bu muteela Nzambi ti: «Tala bwaabeela nkuna aku.» <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Abalahami wuba kampe na mimvu nkama, kansi kiminu kyandi kizeza ko bu kayindula nitu andi yedi kwe syooki mpe na mukazi andi Sala kibutulu kyandi kikota kyozi. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Kiminu kyandi kizeza ko mpe kasa maketiketi ko mu dyambu di nsilulu yi Nzambi. Kansi kiminu ki muhaana ngolo na wukembila Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Wukwikila nakekete ti Nzambi wuu na lulendo mu lungisa nsilulu yi kasa. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ni hahoho, Nzambi kabongila Abalahami bonso muntu wulunungu. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Kansi mpova ezi: «Nzambi wumubongila bonso muntu wulunungu», zisonama mu dyambu di yandi kaka ko. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Zisonama mpe mu dyambu dyeto bakalendi bongila bonso bantu balunungu. Mu dyambu ti tukwe kwikilanga mu yondowo wufulukisa mu bafwa Yesu-Klisto, Mfumu eto. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Wuyekolo mu dyambu di masumu meto na wumufulukisa mu bafwa mwanki tuba bantu balunungu.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutuwawisa na Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Ni hahoho mu kiminu, batubongila bantu balunungu, na tweka bwabu mu kiyenge na Nzambi mu nzila yi Mfumu eto, Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Mu Yesu, mu nzila yi kiminu, tutambudi mulemvo we finama na Nzambi wu tumeni simbidila. Mpe kyese kyeto kikangamani mu kivuvu kyaatukotisa mu nkembo wu Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Kabobo kaka ko, tukwe yenikisanga kyese kyeto mu mpasi zeto, mu dyambu tuzebi ti mpasi zikwe butanga mvibudulu, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />mvibudulu yikwe butanga kukwikama, na kukwikama kukwe butanga kivuvu, <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />mpe kivuvu kifwisanga nsoni ko, mu dyambu ti Nzambi wudukula luzolo lwandi mu mitima myeto mu nzila yi Mpeve Yilongo yi katuhaana.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Mu dyambu ti, bu tuba bantu balebakana, Klisto wufwa mu dyambu di minsumuki, mu ntangu yi zenga Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Mpasi ku muntu mu tambula mu fwa mu dyambu di muntu wumosi wu lunungu. Kulendi ba ti muntu katambula mu fwa mu dyambu di muntu wumbote. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Kansi taleeno bwedi Nzambi kalonkila luzolo lwandi kuu yeto: buna twakidi minsumuki, Klisto wufwa mu dyambu dyeto. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Bu tweka bwabu bantu balunungu mu nzila yi lufwa lu Klisto, ni bwabobo kakwe tuvuukisilanga mu mankesi ma Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Bu tuba mitantu mi Nzambi, wutuwawisa nandi mu lufwa lu Mwana andi. Bwabu butuwawasani nandi, Nzambi waatuvuukisa mu nzila yi luzingu lu Mwana andi. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Kabobo kaka ko, tutudidi kyese kyeto mu Nzambi mu dyambu di Mfumu eto, Yesu-Klisto. Mpe mu yandi bwabu tuwawasani na Nzambi.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adami na Yesu-Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Ni hahoho, masumu makotila mu nza mu dyambu di muntu wumosi, Adami. Mpe mu nzila yi masumu lufwa lukotila, ni bwabobo mpe lufwa lukotila ku bantu bamvimba, mu dyambu ti bamvimba basumuka. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Tekila Nzambi kahaana Misiku ku Mose, masumu makitekidila mu nza. Kansi, Misiku mikibeela ko, Ni hahoho, Nzambi kedi lembolo sembilanga masumu. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Kansi, tuzebi ti kutonina ku Adami natee ku Mose, lufwa lunyeka na lubwidila mpe yobobo balembolo sa masumu bonso masa Adami wulembolo vumina ntumunu yi Nzambi. Adami wuba kifwani ki yondowo wuketi kwiza.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Kansi masumu ma Adami, malendi fwanakana ko na munkayulu wuhaana Nzambi wumpamba. Tuzebi ti bantu babingi bafwa mu dyambu di muntu wumosi bewowo. Kansi mulemvo wu Nzambi wuhyokidi bunene, mpe munkayulu andi wuhyokidi mfunu. Ku babingi munkayulu bewowo wumpamba wubahaanu mu nzila yi muntu wumosi, ni Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Mpe munkayulu wuhaana Nzambi wudi wuswaswana na disumu di muntu wumosi. Buna, ku manima ma disumu di muntu wumosi, mfundusu yi Nzambi yitunatini nsembolo. Kansi munkayulu wumpamba wuhaana Nzambi, wubanatini lunungu mpeleko misamu myawu mimingi mimbi. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Mu dyambu di musamu wumbi wu muntu wumosi, lufwa lunyekini. Ni bwabobo, yobobo batambudi mulemvo wuhyokidi kitezo na munkayulu wulunungu, bana zinga mu Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Ni hahoho, mu musamu wumbi wu muntu wumosi, bantu bamvimba batambudi nsembolo. Bumosi mpe, mu kisalu kimbote ki muntu wumosi, kisidi ti bantu bamvimba bakituka bantu balunungu na bazinga. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Mu muntu wumosi wulembolo tumimina Nzambi, bantu babingi bakitukidi minsumuki, bumosi mpe, mu muntu wumosi wutumimina Nzambi, bantu babingi bakitukidi balunungu.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Misiku miyiza na mi butisa misamu mimbi, kansi huuma ha nyeka masumu, mulemvo wu Nzambi wusempidi. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Ni hahoho, bonso masumu bu malonkidi lulendo lwandi mu nzila yi lufwa, bwabobo mpe mulemvo wu Nzambi wukwe lonkilanga lulendo andi mu nzila yi lunungu, mu tunata ku luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu mu Yesu-Klisto, Mfumu eto.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kubotoko mu Yesu-Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Nki bwabu tulendi ta e? Nganunu tutatamana mu zinga mu masumu mwanki mulemvo wu Nzambi wuvula nyeka e? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Kaani! Yeto tudi bafwa mu masumu: bwedi tulendi bwesa zingila dyaka mu masumu e? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Luzebi ko ti yeto bamvimba tubotoko mu Yesu-Klisto, mu lufwa lwandi tutambudila mbotokolo e? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Buna, mu mbotokolo batuziika ha kimosi nandi mu ba kintwadi mu lufwa lwandi, mwanki, bonso bufuluka Klisto mu bafwa mu lulendo lu nkembo lu Tata, yeto bumosi mpe tudyata mu luzingu lumona.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Buna, tala ti batutuula kintwadi nandi mu lufwa lufwanakani bonso lu lwandi, mbo tuba mpe kintwadi nandi mu mfulukulu yifwanakani bonso yi yandi. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Watuzebi ti: nitu eto yintama yabakoma ha kulunsi ha kimosi na Klisto, mwanki nitu eto yi masumu yifwa na tulembolo bwesa ba mindongo mi masumu. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Mu dyambu ti yondowo fwidi na Klisto weka muntu wulunungu, na kasiidi dyaka na masumu ko. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Kansi tala ti tufwidi ha kimosi na Klisto, tukwikidi ti mbo tuzinga mpe ha kimosi nandi. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Tuzebi ti Klisto, bu kafuluka mu bafwa, kalendi bwesa fwa ko: lufwa lusidi dyaka na lulendo mu yandi ko. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Bu kafwa, wufwa nkumbu yimosi kaka ki mankululu mu dyambu di masumu ma bantu. Kansi bwabu bu kadi wumoyo, wuna zinga mu dyambu di Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Yeno mpe bumosi, lukibongila bonso bantu bafwa mu masumu, mpe bantu bamoyo mu dyambu di Nzambi, mu kintwadi na Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Masumu malendi bwesa yaala nitu eno yaafwa ko, mwanki malembolo lusindisila mu tumimina nsatu zeno zi kinsuni. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Lubikandi binama byeno bi nitu mu masumu ko bonso bisalulu byehidikila misamu mimbi. Kansi lufweti kiyekola kimankululu yeno bende ku Nzambi bonso bantu bafulukidi mu bafwa na beka bamoyo. Mboki haaneeno nitu zeno zimvimba zisadila Nzambi bonso bisalulu bi lunungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Bwabu, masumu malendi bwesa ba na luyaalu mu yeno ko. Mu dyambu ti lusidi dyaka ku nsye Misiku ko, kansi ku nsye mulemvo wu Nzambi.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mindongo mi misamu lunungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Nki bwabu e? Nganunu tulendi hidika kweto masumu mu dyambu ti tusidi dyaka ku nsye lutumu lu Misiku ko, kansi mu mulemvo wu Nzambi e? Kaani! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Walutomini zaba ti: tala ti luna sadila muntu mu mutumimina, lweka bonso bisadi bi mfumu beyoyo yi luna tumimina, hoti luna tumimina masumu, makwe natanga ku lufwa, hoti luna tumimina Nzambi, yandi kwe natanga ku luzingu lu lunungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Kansi tuvutuleeno matondo ku Nzambi mu dyambu ti, yeno luteka ba mindongo mi masumu. Bwabu lutumamani mu mitima myeno mimvimba, mu ndongosolo yi kintwadi yi lutambula. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Lukululu mu bundongo bu masumu, mpe lweka mindongo mi misamu mi lunungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Nina zonzila bonso bukwe zonzilanga bantu mu dyambu dilebakani kweno mu bakula. Mu ntama, lusadila binama bi nitu zeno mu kitula byo bonso mindongo mi misamu mi busafu na mimbi. Bumosi mpe mu ntangu beyiyi, sadileeno binama bi nitu zeno mu kitula byo bonso mindongo mi misamu mi lunungu mu ba na luzingu lu bulongo.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Mu ntangu yi luba mindongo mi masumu, mu kimpwanza luba ha ntadisi yi lunungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Buna nkye mpila mbutu ziba neeno e? Mbutu zi lweyenina nsoni bwabu, mu dyambu ti nsukunu yawu, ni lufwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Kansi bwabu, lukulukidi mu masumu, mpe lweka mindongo mi Nzambi. Bwabu mbutu zi luna yonzika, ni luzingu lulongo, mpe ku nsukunu, ni luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Mu dyambu ti, mufutu wu masumu ni lufwa, kansi munkayulu wumpamba wukwe haananga Nzambi, ni luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu mu Yesu-Klisto, Mfumu eto.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Bafwa ludi ha ntadisi yi Misiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Mpangi zani, bwabu ku bantu bazebi Misiku nina zonza, luzimbakanandi ko ti Misiku mikwe yaalanga muntu bu kakidi wumoyo. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Bumosi mpe ku mukento wukwela, wukangama kadi mu Misiku mi makwela ku mulumi andi tala ti wakidi wumoyo. Kansi tala ti mulumi wufwidi, kasiidi dyaka wukangama mu Misiku wu makwela na bakala bedyodyo ko. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Tala ti mulumi wakidi wumoyo na wenzi kwela bakala dihiika, weka nsuza. Kansi, tala ti mulumi wufwidi, yandi beki kimpwanza ha ntadisi yi Misiku, mpe baamutumisina nsuza ko bu keka mukento wu bakala dihiika. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Bumosi mpe ku yeno zimpangi zani, lweka bantu bafwa ha ntadisi yi Misiku bu lweka kintwadi na nitu yi Klisto. Muntu wuhiika bwabu wuluvwidi, ni yondowo wufuluka mu bafwa, mwanki tubuta mimbutu mu dyambu di Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Mu dyambu ti mu ntangu yitwedi teka zinganga mu kimuntu, mpwila zi masumu mu luyaalu lu Misiku zedi salanga mu binama byeto, mwanki zibuta mimbutu mikwe natanga ku lufwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Kansi bwabu tweka mu kimpwanza ha ntadisi yi Misiku mu dyambu ti, tweka bafwa mu myo myedi tukanganga mu kinkole, mwanki tusadila mu nsalulu yimoona yi Mpeve, kansi ka mu luyaalu luntama lu Misiku misonama ko.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masumu na Misiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Nki tulendi ta bwabu e? Musiku, disumu didi e? Kaani! Kansi, ni mu Misiku kaka nzabidi masumu. Na keti zaba nzinunu ko tala ti Misiku mita ko ti: «Kuzininandi ko.» <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Masumu bu mabaka hwahwa mu lutumu, ni mabuta mu meno nzinunu zimvimba zi mumpila-mumpila. Mu dyambu ti, tala ti kunaani Misiku, masumu kima kifwa kwandi kidi. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Mu ntama, Misiku bu myedi lembolo banga, nedi zinganga. Kansi lutumu bu lwizidi, masumu ma bwesi baka luzingu <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />mpe meno neka muntu wufwa. Ni hahoho, lutumu luketi nata ku luzingu, luneti ku lufwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Mu dyambu ti, masumu bu mabaka hwahwa mu nzila yi lutumu, mampuna, mpe ni manata ku lufwa.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Ni hahoho, Musiku wulongo wudi, mpe lutumu ludi lulongo, lunungu na mbote. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Nganunu misamu mimbote milendi tuukisa lufwa ku meno e? Kaani! Kansi masumu masadidi mi misamu mimbote mu nata ku lufwa. Bwabobo lutumu lusidi ti masumu mayenika nkatika kima kimbi, mpe mandonkidi bubi.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mundongo wu masumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Tuzebi ti Misiku misamu mi kimpeve midi. Kansi meno muntu wu kinsuni nidi, wuyaduku bonso mundongo wu masumu. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Kedika, misamu mi nina hidika, nina mye bakula ko. Myo mintidi, nina mye hidika ko. Kansi myo mi nina lembolo tya, myamyomyo nina hidika. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Tala ti, nina hidika myo mi nina lembolo tya, mbakudi ti Musiku wumbote wudi. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Bwabu, ka meno ko nina hidika bobo, kansi ni masumu mana zinga mu meno.<verse eid="ROM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Kadi, nzebi ti nidi na misamu mimbote ko, mpila mosi mu kimuntu kyani. Nidi na luzolo mu hidika misamu mimbote, kansi nidi na lulendo ko mu hidika myo. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Mu dyambu ti, misamu mimbote mi natiidi, nina hidika myo ko. Kansi misamu mimbi mi nina lembolo tya, myamyomyo nina hidika. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Tala ti nina hidika misamu mi nina lembolo tya, nasidi dyaka meno ko nina hidika myo, kansi ni masumu mana zinga mu meno.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Bwabu ni nabakudi Musiku ewu: tala ti ntiidi mu hidika misamu mimbote, ni misamu mimbi kaka nakwe lendanga mu hidika. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Mu kati di mutima ani, nakwe yangalalanga Misiku mi Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Kansi, mu kati di nitu ani yimvimba, nakwe yenanga ti Musiku wuhiika wukwe nwanisanga Musiku wu madyela mani, mpe wukwe nkitulanga nkole yi Musiku wu masumu wudi mu nitu ani. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Aa kyadi meno muntu! Nani kwani waankuula mu nitu yilufwa e? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Nina vutula matondo ku Nzambi mu nzila yi Yesu-Klisto, Mfumu eto!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Bwabu, mu madyela mani, nidi mundongo wu Musiku wu Nzambi, kansi mu kimuntu kyani, nidi mundongo wu Musiku wu masumu.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Kuzinga ha kimosi na Mpeve yi Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Bwabu, kusiidi dyaka nsembolo ko ku yobobo badi mu Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Mu dyambu ti, musiku wu Mpeve wukwe haananga luzingu mu Yesu-Klisto, wunkudidi mu musiku wu masumu na wu lufwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Nzambi wulungisa misamu bemyomyo milembana Misiku mi Mose, mu dyambu ti, lebakani di kinsuni di mumanisa lulendo: mu katula masumu, ni kasemba mo bu katambika Mwana andi mwanki kazinga mu lunitu lu muntu wufwanakani na muntu wu masumu, <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Nzambi kasila bobo mwanki lunungu, mu nzila yi Misiku, lulunga mu yeto tukwe lembolo zinganga mu luyaalu lu kinsuni, kansi lu Mpeve. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Yobobo badi mu nsuni, nsatu zawu mu bima bi kinsuni, kansi, yobobo badi mu Mpeve, nsatu zawu mu bima bi kimpeve. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Nsatu zi nsuni zikwe natanga ku lufwa, kansi nsatu zi Mpeve zikwe natanga ku luzingu na kiyenge. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Mu dyambu ti nsatu zi nsuni, zikwe natanga kitantu na Nzambi, mpe zikwe tumiminanga Misiku mi Nzambi ko, na zilendi mye sadila ko. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Yobobo badi ku nsye luyaalu lu nsuni, balendi yangidika Nzambi ko.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Yeno, ludi ku nsye luyaalu lu nsuni ko, kansi lu Mpeve, mu dyambu ti Mpeve yi Nzambi yii mu yeno. Tala ti muntu kadi na Mpeve yi Klisto ko, kadi muntu andi ko. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Mpe tala ti Klisto wuu mu yeno, nitu eno yaafwa kaka mu dyambu di masumu, kansi Mpeve yidi luzingu mu yeno, mu dyambu ti baalukitula bantu balunungu ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Mpe tala ti Mpeve yi yondowo wufulukisa Yesu-Klisto mu bafwa yina zinga mu yeno, Nzambi wufulukisa Yesu-Klisto mu bafwa, waahaana mpe mu nzila yi Mpeve andi yikwe zinganga mu yeno, luzingu ku nitu zeno zi lufwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Ni hahoho, zimpangi zani, mfuka yii neto. Kansi, tulendi zinga bonso buna tumina nsuni eto ko. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Mu dyambu ti, tala ti luna zinga mu kinsuni, lwaafwa. kansi tala ti mu Mpeve, luna honda ndyatulu eno yi kinsuni, mpe luna zinga. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Bantu bamvimba bana twadusu ku Mpeve yi Nzambi, baala ba Nzambi badi. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Mu dyambu ti Mpeve yilutambula, yikwe lukitulanga mindongo ko mwanki luba na bunkuta, kansi Mpeve Yilongo yilutambula, yikwe lukitulanga baala ba Nzambi. Mpe mu Mpeve beyoyo, tuna looka ti: «Aba, mpila mosi, Tata!» <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Mpeve yi Nzambi yikwe tanga yandi bende kimbangi ku mpeve eto ti, baala ba Nzambi tudi. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Ni hahoho, tala ti baala bandi tudi, buna twaabyadila fwa, na twaabyadila fwa di Nzambi, mpe twaabyadila fwa ha kimosi na Klisto, mu dyambu ti, tala ti tuna yena mpasi ha kimosi nandi, mpe mbo tutambula kikunku ki nkembo andi.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkembo wuna kwiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Nazebi ti mpasi zi tuna yena ntangu beyiyi, zilendi fwanakana na nkembo waatulonka Nzambi ko. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Mu dyambu ti, bima bimvimba bihidika Nzambi, bina kingila mu mpwila yiyingi nkembo wu Nzambi wu kaayenikisa ku baala bandi. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Mu dyambu ti, bima bimvimba bihidika Nzambi, biyekolo ku nsye luyaalu lulembolo ba mfunu. Ka mu luzolo lwandi ko, kansi mu luzolo lu Nzambi wuyekola byo. Kivuvu kidi ti: <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />bima bimvimba bebyobyo bihidika Nzambi, byaakuuluka mu kinkole ki lulendo luna mwangisa byo, mu baka kimpwanza na nkembo wu baala ba Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Tuzebi ti natee mu kilokola bekiki, bima bimvimba bihidika Nzambi, bina kunga bonso mukento wuu na misongo mye butila. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Ka bima bimvimba bihidika Nzambi kaka ko bina yena mpasi, kansi yeto mpe tutambula Mpeve Yilongo bonso kikunku kintete ki minkayulu mi tusila Nzambi nsilulu, tuna kunga ku nsye mutima, tekila Nzambi katukitula baala bandi mpe kakuula nitu zeto mu mpasi zawu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Mu dyambu ti tubaka mpulusu, kansi mu kivuvu kaka. Tala ti tuna sa kivuvu mu bima bi tuna yena, kisidi dyaka kivuvu ko. Nani bwabu lenda sa dyaka kivuvu mu bima bi kana yena e? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Kansi tala ti tuna sa kivuvu mu bima bi tuna lembolo yena, tuna kingila byo mu luvibudulu.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Bumosi mpe, Mpeve yikwe tusadisanga tala ti tulebakani, mu dyambu ti, tuzebi mu sambila ko bonso bufwanakani. Kansi, Mpeve yandi bende kwe tusambidilanga mu zimpova muntu zi kalendi lembolo duukisa. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />mpe Nzambi wukwe toma sungiminanga mitima, zebi mbanzulu zi Mpeve: bwabobo Mpeve kakwe sambidilanga bantu balongo bonso budi luzolo lu Nzambi.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Tuzebi ti bima bimvimba bina lonka mambote ku yobobo batiidi Nzambi, yobobo bakatumisa bonso budi makani mandi. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Mu dyambu ti, Nzambi wuteka basoola na wukana ntete mu bafwanikisa na Mwana andi, mwanki yandi kaba kihunda ki zimpangi zizingi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Yobobo bakasoola ntete, wubatumisa mpe. Yobobo bakatumisa, wubakitula bantu balunungu. Mpe yobobo bakakitula bantu balunungu, wubakembisa.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nki bilendi tuhambisa na luzolo lu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Nki tulendi ta bwabu dyaka e?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:31">Tala ti Nzambi wuu ku sambu dyeto, nani waatubela e?<verse eid="ROM 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Yandi wulembolo tanina Mwana wu yandi bende, kansi wumuyekola mu dyambu di yeto bamvimba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:32">Bila nki, mu lusakumunu lwandi kaalembolo tuhaanina bima bimvimba ha kimosi na Mwana andi e?<verse eid="ROM 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Nani waafunda bantu basoola Nzambi e? Ni Nzambi wubasoola baba bantu balunungu.<verse eid="ROM 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Nani waababedisa e? Mu dyambu ti Yesu-Klisto wufwa, mpe wufuluka, wuu wuzakala ha lweka lu kooko ku lubakala lu Nzambi, mpe kwe tusambidilanga!<verse eid="ROM 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Nani lenda tuhambisa mu luzolo lu Klisto e? Mpasi hoti nzungu, mfyetokoso hoti nsatu, bumputu, nsisi hoti mbele yi mvita e?<verse eid="ROM 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Bonso bu wusonama ti :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">«Mu dyambu dyaku bana tuhondila kilumbu kimvimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">bana tubongila bonso mameme mafweti zengo ngongodinga.»<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Kansi, mu mimvimba bemyomyo, tunungini mu nzila yi yondowo wututya. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Ee, nkwikidi ti kunaani kima kilendi tuhambisa na luzolo lu Nzambi : ni luba lufwa, luzingu, zimbazi, bimfumu, bima bi ntangu beyiyi na bina kwiza, lulendo, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />ngolo zi yulu na zi butoto, mpe kani kima kihiika kihidika Nzambi kilenda tuhambisa na luzolo lu Nzambi luyenikini mu Yesu-Klisto, Mfumu eto.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Nzambi na kanda di Isaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Kikedika nina ta mu Klisto, mpe nina huna ko. Mayindu ma mutima ani mana nteela kimbangi mu Mpeve Yilongo: <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Nafulukidi mu kyadi na mutima ani wuna yena mpasi zina lembolo hwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Ninga! Natya naba kwani mebende muntu wusingu ku Nzambi, mpe wuhambana na Klisto mu dyambu di zimpangi zani, ba tudi kanda dimosi . <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Zimpangi bezozo, ni kanda di bisi-Isaeli: Nzambi wubakitula baala bandi, wubakubikila nkembo andi, wutunga luwawanu nawu, wubahaana Misiku, wubalonka bwedi bwe musambidilanga mpe wubasila nsilulu. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Bisi-Isaeli bebobo badi mu nkuna yi matata meto, mpe Klisto mu lunitu lu muntu, wudi wumosi mu nkuna awu. Bika Nzambi kwe yaalanga bima bimvimba kasiiku mimvu ka mimvu. Ameni!<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Tuteedi ko ti Mambu ma Nzambi masiidi dyaka mfunu ko. Mu dyambu ti ka bamvimba bafuma mu nkuna yi Isaeli baa baala ba-Isaeli, <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />mpe baala ba Abalahami, bamvimba badi mu nkuna andi ko. Mu dyambu ti Nzambi wuta ku Abalahami ti: «Ni mu Isaaki waabakila nkuna yi nakusila nsilulu.» <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Mpila mosi ti: ka baala babutuka mu nsuni ko badi baala ba Nzambi. Kansi, ni baala ba butuka mu nsilulu yi Nzambi baaba mu lutangu belolo lu nkuna. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi wusa nsilulu bu kata ti: «Bu naavutuka mu ntangu beyiyi na Salayi waaba na mwana wu bakala.»<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Misamu kamyamimi kwandi ko, Lebika mpe wubuta nsimba zandi mu tata dimosi, Isaaki, nkaka eto. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Buna baala babutukidi ko, mpe bahiidikidi kani musamu wumbi na wumbote ko, Nzambi bu kazonza ku Lebika, mwanki makani mandi masikila. <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Wusa bobo, mwanki luzolo lwandi lu hilama, nsodolo andi yiba mu dyambu di mavanga mawu ko, kansi mu mbokolo andi. Nzambi bu kata ku Lebika ti: «Kihunda kyaaba kisadi ki mpangi andi.» <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Bonso buu wusonama ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:13">«Natya Yakobi, kansi nayangalala Esawu ko.»<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Nki bwabu tulendi ta e? Nganunu, Nzambi kadi wulunungu ko e? Kaani! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Kadi yandi wuta ku Mose ti: «Mbo nafwiila nkenda wonso muntu wu natiidi mu fwila nkenda, mpe mbo nayenina kyadi wonso muntu wu natiidi mu fwila kyadi.» <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Bwabu lusiidi dyaka luzolo lu muntu ko hoti ngolo zandi ko, kansi Nzambi kwe fwilanga muntu nkenda. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Ni hahoho mu Masonama, Nzambi kateela ku ntinu yi Ngipiti ti: «Nakusoodidi ntinu mu lonka mu nzila aku, lulendo lwani, mpe mwanki nkumbu ani yisamunu mu nza yimvimba.» <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Bwabobo mpe, Nzambi kwe fwilanga nkenda wonso muntu wukatiidi, mpe kwe haananga mutu-ngolo ku wonso muntu wukatiidi.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mankesi na nkenda zi Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Kampe mbo wunteela ti: «Nki bwabu Nzambi kakwe tusembilanga e? Nani bwabu lendi tedimina luzolo lu Nzambi e?» <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Kansi, ngeye nani wudi mu bangisa Nzambi e? Kisiku ki tubumba lendi ta ku yondowo wumuhidikidi ti: «Nki mpidikidi bobo e?» <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Kihidiki ki bisiku bi tubumba kwe sanga mi katiidi na tubumba: mu tubumba, lendi hidika kisiku kintalu hoti kisiku kilembolo ba mfunu.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Nki tulendi ta, tala ti Nzambi mu lonka mankesi na lulendo lwandi, wuvibidila bubwingi bantu bafwanakana mu bwidila mankesi mandi na mu tambula lufwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Kasila bobo, mwanki kalonka kimvwama ki nkembo andi ku yobobo bakayenina nkenda, mpe yobobo ba kakubika tuka ntama mu kota kintwadi na nkembo andi. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Ni yeto bantu bakatumisa mu ba ha kati di Bayudayo kaka ko, kansi ha kati mpe di yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Bonso bu wudi wusonama mu buuku di mumbikudi Oseya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">« Mbo natumisina mukangu ani, wowowo wulembolo ba mukangu ani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">mpe mbo namutumisina muntu wu natiidi, yondowo wu nedi lembolo tyanga.<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Mpe ha bibuka bibedi bateelanga ti: “Yeno ludi mukangu ani”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">mbo babatumisina ti baala ba Nzambi yimoyo.»<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Mu myomyo mitadidi Isaeli, mumbikudi Yesaya wulooka ti: «Yeno baala ba-Isaeli, mpeleko lufunani bonso munyenge wuu ha kumu di mubu, mwa ndambu yi bantu kaka yaavuuka.» <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Mu dyambu ti Mfumu mbo kalungisa Mambu mandi mamvimba mu nswalu ha luse lu butoto. <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Bonso buta wo mumbikudi Yesaya ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">«Tala ti Mfumu Sebaoti katusisila kani nkuna yimosi ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">nganunu tukituka bonso mbanza yi Sodomo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">na tufwanakana na mbanza yi Ngomola.»<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lunungu mu nzila yi kiminu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Nki bwabu tulendi ta e? Balembolo ba Bayudayo bedi lembolo sosanga lunungu, babaka lo, lunungu belolo lukwe fumanga mu kiminu. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Kansi ba-Isaeli bedi sosanga mu ba bantu balunungu mu nzila yi Misiku, balembakana. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Hambo mu dyambu di nki e? Mu dyambu ti Isaeli wusosa lunungu, ka mu nzila yi kiminu ko, kansi mu nzila yi mavanga. Ni bayenda koyama ha tadi dikwe bwisanga, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />bonso bu wusonama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">«Meno nina tuula mu mbanza yi Syoni tadi dikwe bwisanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">tadi dilendi bwisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">kansi muntu siidi kiminu kyandi mu yandi, kaafwa nsoni ko.»<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Mpangi zani, dyambu divudi nkinzi ku nsye mutima ani, mpe lusambulu lwani ku Nzambi mu dyambu di Bayudayo, ludi ti babaka mpulusu. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Mu dyambu ti, nalendi ta kimbangi mu vema kwawu mu Nzambi, kansi vema kwawu kudi kusikama mu nzayilu yikedika ko. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Bazebi lunungu lukwe haananga Nzambi ko, mpe bakwe sosanga mu ba mu ngolo zi yawu bende bantu balunungu, ni hahoho, bakwe lembolo tumiminanga lunungu lukwe haananga Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Mu dyambu ti, Klisto wudi nsukunu yi Misiku, mwanki minkwikidi mimvimba mitambula lunungu.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mambu ma Nzambi, kiminu na mpulusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Taleeno bwedi Mose kasonikina musamu wutadidi lunungu lukwe fumanga mu Misiku: «Muntu kwe tumiminanga Misiku, waazinga mu Misiku.» <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Kansi, lunungu lukwe fumanga mu kiminu luna zonzila ebu: «Kutandi ku nsye mutima aku ko ti: nani waatomboka ku yulu e?» (Mpila mosi ti Klisto bana kulumuna ku nsi.) <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Kutandi mpe dyaka ti: «Nani waakulumuka ku nsi yi bafwa e?» (Mpila mosi ti Klisto bana tombola ku nsi yi bafwa.) <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Nki kana sosa mu ta e? Mambu ma Nzambi maa lukufi naku, madi mu munwa aku na mu mutima aku. Mambu ma Nzambi bemomo, ni mambu ma kiminu ma tuna kwe samuni. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Tala ti samuni mu munwa aku ti Yesu Mfumu kadi na kwikidi mu nkatika mutima aku ti Nzambi wumufulukisa mu bafwa, waavuuka. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Mu dyambu ti, kukwikila mu mutima kukwe natanga mu nzila yi lunungu, mpe kusamuna mu munwa, kukwe natanga ku mpulusu. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Bonso bukwe tanga Masonama ti: «Wonso muntu kwikidi mu yandi, kaafwa nsoni ko.» <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ni hahoho, kuu diswaswani ko ha kati di Bayudayo na balembolo ba Bayudayo: bamvimba Mfumu yimosi kaka yii nawu, yikwe lonkanga mambote ku yobobo bamvimba bakwe mu sambilanga. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Mu dyambu wusonama ti: «Wonso muntu waatumisa nkumbu yi Mfumu, waavuuka.»<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Kansi bwedi balendi tumisina Mfumu, tala ti bakwikidi mu yandi ko e? Mpe bwedi balendi kwikila mu yandi, tala ti bamuyudi ko e? Mpe bwedi balendi muyuwila, tala ti kunaani muntu wuna musamuna e? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Mpe bwedi balendi musamunina, tala ti batambikidi muntu ko e? Bonso wudi wusonama: «Oo! Budi bumbote mu yena bantu bana kwiza, bana kwe samuni misamu mimbote!» <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Kansi, bamvimba batambudi Musamu Wumbote ko. Yesaya wuta ti: «Mfumu, nani kwikidi mu ndongosolo eto e?» <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Buna kiminu kikwe fumanga mu myo mi tukwe yuwanga, mpe myo mi tukwe yuwanga, mikwe fumanga mu Mambu ma Klisto.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzambi kanyafuni mukangu andi ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Kansi nina fuula bwabu: «Nganunu bayuwa ko e?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">Ninga! Ndinga awu yiyuwakana mu nza yimvimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">mpe mambu mawu mayenda natee ku sukina nza.»<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Kansi nina fuula bwabu: «Nganunu Isaeli kabakula ko e? Mose wuta tuuka ntama ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">Meno mbo nalukitula bantu ba musoki ku yobobo balembolo ba kanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">Mbo nalufwemisa mu bantu balembolo ba na madyela.»<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Mumbikudi Yesaya wubwesa zonza dyaka ti :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">«Nabakulu ku yobobo bedi lembolo nsosa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">Nazabakani ku yobobo bedi lembolo ndomba kima.»<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Kansi mu misamu mitadidi Isaeli, wuta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">«Kilumbu kimvimba ndambudi moko mani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">ku mukangu wukwe lembolo tumamanga na wukwe nangumukanga.»<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Nzambi kanyafuna Isaeli ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Nina fuula bwabu: Nganunu Nzambi wunyafuna mukangu andi e? Nkatika kaani! Mu dyambu ti mebende mwisi-Isaeli nidi, mu nkuna yi Abalahami, mu kifumba ki Benyami. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Nzambi kanyafuna mukangu andi wukateka soola ko. Luzebi ko misamu bemyomyo mita Masonama mu ntangu mumbikudi Eliya bu kedi nyonga ha ntadisi yi Nzambi mu dyambu di Isaeli: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Mfumu, bahondidi mimbikudi myaku, bamwangisi maziku ma bakwe yokilanga minkayulu, meno hiika nsidi mpe bana sosa mu mponda. <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Kansi, Nzambi nkye mvutu kamuhaana e? Nkebidi mu dyambu di mebende mafunda nsambwadi ma bantu, yobobo balembolo fukama ha ntadisi yi nzambi yi Baali. <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Bumosi mpe mu ntangu beyiyi, mwa ndambu yi bantu yisidi Nzambi yi kasoodidi mu bumbote bwandi. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Yandi wubasoola mu dyambu di bumbote bwandi, kansi ka mu dyambu di bisalu byawu ko. Nganunu bumbote bu Nzambi bu keti bwesa ba nkatika bumbote ko.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Nki bwabu tulendi ta e? Isaeli kabaka bima bi kedi kwe sosingi ko, kansi yobobo kwandi Nzambi bakasoola babaka byo, mpe bahiika bayiza ba na mitima mikangama, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />bonso bu wusonama ti: «Nzambi wubahaana mpeve ye nungina, mwanki meso mawu malembolo yena, mpe makutu mawu malembolo yuwa natee mu kilumbu bekiki.» <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Ntinu Davidi mpe wuta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">«Bika ndambisa zawu ziba mutambu ku yawu, mpwasa, dyambu dya babwisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">na dya bahaana nsembolo.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Bika meso mawu makituka mpimpa natee bu mafwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">sa ti ntangu zimvimba mungongo awu wuba nakondondo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mikunga 69.23-24</char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Nina fuula bwabu: Bayudayo bu bata kuba, nganunu babwa mvimba e? Nkatika kaani! Kansi mu dyambu di masumu mawu, balembolo ba Bayudayo batambudi mpulusu mwanki Bayudayo babasila kimpala. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Tala ti masumu ma Bayudayo matwedi kimvwama ki nza, mpe kibwa kyawu kitwedi kimvwama ki balembolo ba Bayudayo, bwedi bwaabeela bunene bu mambote mawu bu balanda nzila yi mpulusu e?<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpulusu ku yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Nina ta bwabu ku yeno lulembolo ba Bayudayo: bu nii ntumwa yi balembolo ba Bayudayo. Nakwe yangalalanga mu kisalu kyani, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />mpe nii na kivuvu ti, mbo natuukisa kimpala ki yobobo batudi menga mamosi, mwanki navuukisa mwa ndambu ha kati dyawu. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Tala ti bu babatuula ha lweka, nza yiwawasana na Nzambi, ntambudulu awu bwedi yaabela dyaka e? Yaaba bonso mvutukulu yi bafwa mu luzingu.<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Tala ti luheeni ndambu yintete yi kiputi ki dimpa ku Nzambi, kiputi kimvimba kisidi kyeka mpe kyandi. Mpe tala ti luheeni ku Nzambi myanzi mi muti, bintala mpe byeka byandi. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Isaeli wudi bonso muti wu olive wuu ku nsye mpanda, Nzambi wukazengidi mwa ndambu yi bintala, kansi ngeye wulembolo ba Muyudayo, bakubaatisi mu sasa mu bintala bihiika, mwanki wukudila mu maka ma mwanzi ma muti wu olive, <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Ni hahoho, kusafulandi bintala bibazengidi ko. Bwedi lenda kitumpidika e? Zaba ti ka ngeye ko wuna kwe nati mwanzi, kansi mwanzi wuna kwe kunati.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Mbo wunteela ti: «Bintala bebyobyo bizengo mwanki meno naba wubatama mu muti.» <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Wukedika wudi. Bazengila byo mu dyambu ti biba na kiminu ko, mpe wudi wutelama nakekete mu dyambu di kiminu kyaku. Kansi, kukitumpidikandi ko! Keba kwaku. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Tala ti Nzambi katabila Bayudayo, bintala bi miti mimena myabende ko, ngeye mpe kaakutabila ko. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Bakula bwabu nkasu na bumbote bu Nzambi: nkasu ku yoyobo babwidi, mpe bumbote bwandi ku ngeye tala ti kangamani mu bumbote bwandi. Tala ti kabobo ko, ngeye mpe mbo bakukwangula. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Tala ti ba-Isaeli batatamani ko mulembolo kwikila, yawu babaatama mu muti mu sasa, mu dyambu ti, Nzambi wuu na lulendo mu baabatika dyaka mu muti. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Ngeye wudi kintala ki muti wu olive wuu ku nsye mpanda, ki zengidi Nzambi na ki kabaatisi, na weka wubaatama mu muti wu olive wu bakunini. Kansi Bayudayo badi bintala bi muti wu olive bewowo wu bakunini. Nzambi lendi babaatika dyaka mu muti wu yawu bende.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpulusu yi Isaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Mpangi zani, mwanki lulembolo kibongila bonso bantu bandwenga, natiidi mu luzabikisa makani bemomo ma mpulusu ma yenikisa Nzambi: ndambu yi mukangu wu Isaeli yina lembana mubakula mo natee makanda mamvimba ma bantu bahiika bu maatambula mpulusu. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Bwabobo mpe kanda dimvimba di Isaeli dyaavuukila, bonso bu wusonama ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">Kikuudi kyaafuma ku mulandu wu Syoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">mbo kakatula nsadulu zimbi mu nkuna yi Yakobi.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Luwawanu lwalolo naatunga nawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:27">bu naakatula masumu mawu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesaya 59.20-21 na Yesaya 27.9; Yelemiya 31.33-34</char></note>.<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Mu myo mitadidi Musamu Wumbote, tuzebi ti mitantu midi mu dyambu dyeno. Kansi, mu myo mitadidi nsoodolo yi Nzambi, bantu bazolakana badi mu dyambu di matata mawu. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Mu dyambu ti, Nzambi kabwesa bonganga minkayulu mi kaheeni ko, na kakwe kitulanga mbokolo andi ko. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Mu ntama, lutumimina Nzambi ko. Kansi bwabu lutambudi nkenda zi Nzambi, mu dyambu ti Bayudayo babisa mu tumama. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Bumosi yawu mpe babisa bwabu mu tumama, mwanki lutambula nkenda zi Nzambi, mwanki yawu mpe bazaba bwabu nkenda bezozo. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Mu dyambu ti, Nzambi wusa ti bantu bamvimba baba bonso mu boloko mulembolo mutumimina, mwanki bamvimba batambula nkenda zandi.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bunene bu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Oo! Nkye mpila mpinda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">buu kimvwama, ndwenga na nzayilu yi Nzambi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Nani lenda bangula nzengolo zandi e?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Nani lenda bakula makani mandi e?<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Nani bwabu wuzaba mbanzulu zi Mfumu e?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">Nani wuba kihaani ki malongi ku yandi e?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Nani wuntete wumuhaana kima e?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:35">Mwanki kamufuta e?<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Mu dyambu ti bimvimba bikwe fumanga ku yandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:36">mu yandi na ku kwandi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:36">Bika nkembo wuba ku Nzambi mimvu ka mimvu! Ameni!<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Luzingu lumona na Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Mpangi zani, mu dyambu di nkenda zi Nzambi, nina lulomba mu haana nitu zeeno bonso munkayulu wumoyo, wulongo mpe wuna yangidika Nzambi. Ku yeno, kwaaba kukembisa kukedika mpe kufwanakani. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Lulandandi mbelo yi bantu ba nza beyiyi ko, kansi kitukeeno bamona mu madyela, mwanki luba na lulendo lwe bakula luzolo lu Nzambi: mu zaba dyambu dimbote, dikwe muyangidikanga mpe dilunga.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Mu dyambu di mulemvo wumpaana Nzambi, nalombidi ku wumosi-wumosi ku yeno, mbanzulu zeeno zihyokandi kitezo na bu ludi ko, kansi beeno na kimpombo bonso budi kiminu ki haana Nzambi ku wumosi-wumosi mu yeno. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Mu nitu yimosi, tuu na binama bibingi, mpe binama bimvimba bikwe salanga kisalu kimosi ko. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Bumosi mpe yeto tuu babingi, nitu yimosi kwandi tudi mu Klisto mpe yeto na yeto tudi bakangama mu nitu yimosi. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Nzambi wutuhaana minkayulu miswaswana, bonso budi mambote mandi. Tala ti wumosi ha kati dyeto wuu na munkayulu we bikula, bika kabikula bonso buu kitezo ki kiminu. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Wumosi wuu na munkayulu we sadisa, bika kasadisa, wuu na munkayulu we longa, bika kalonga, <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />wuu na munkayulu we syamisa, bika kasyamisa. Yondowo wuu na munkayulu we kaba, bika kakabula mu mutima wuzibuka. Yondowo wuna twadisa, bika katwadisa mu bunkete bonso. Yondowo wuna sadisa bantu baa mu mpasi, bika kabasadisa mu kyese.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Bika luzolo lweno lulembolo ba lu diisu ku nsye lukaya. Tineeno mambi, kangameeno mu mambote:<verse eid="ROM 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Bika mu kimpangi kyeno, lutoma zolasana yeno na yeno.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:10">Beeno bantete mutoma vumasana yeno na yeno.<verse eid="ROM 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Beeno na vema, kansi ka bulenga ko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:11">Lemeeno mu mpeve na sadileeno Mfumu.<verse eid="ROM 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Yangalaleeno mu dyambu di kivuvu kyeno.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:12">Vibidileeno mu ntangu yi mpasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:12">Mpe tatamaneeno mu lusambulu.<verse eid="ROM 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Sadiseeno balongo baa mu mbindumunu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:13">Tatamaneeno mu tambulanga baneeno bumbote.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Sakumuneeno yobobo bana lufyetikisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:14">Basakumuneeno, na lubasingandi ko.<verse eid="ROM 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Yangalaleeno ha kimosi na yobobo bana yangalala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:15">Dileeno ha kimosi na yobobo bana dila.<verse eid="ROM 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Yuwasaneeno yeno na yeno.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:16">Lubandi bantu ba mayama ko, kansi beeno bakuluka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:16">Mpe lukiyenikisandi bantu bandwenga ko.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Luvutulandi mbi mu mbi ko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:17">Seeno ngolo mu hidika misamu mimbote ha ntadisi yi bamvimba.<verse eid="ROM 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Tala ti bulendi ba mpe lulendi bwe sa, lufweti zinga mu kiyenge na bantu bamvimba.<verse eid="ROM 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Mpangi zani zizola, luvutulandi mbi yeno bende ko, kansi bikeeno mankesi ma Nzambi masala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:19">Mu dyambu ti wusonama: «Meno nakwe fundisanga! Meno nakwe vutulanga mambi.» Mfumu zonzidi.<verse eid="ROM 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Kansi wudi mpe wusonama ti: «Tala ti mutantu aku wuu na nsatu, muhaana bindya kadya, wuu na mpwila yi mamba, muhaana mo kanwa. Mu dyambu ti, bu wuna sadila bobo, ni makala matiya wuna yonzika ha yulu mutu andi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zingana 25.21-22</char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Kubiikandi mambi ma kubedisa ko, kansi bedisa mambi mu mambote.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kivumi ku zimfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Kadi muntu fweti vumina zimfumu zikwe tuyaalanga. Mu dyambu ti, kimfumu ku Nzambi kikwe fumanga, mpe zimfumu zo zina yaala, Nzambi kwe byekanga zo. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Ni hahoho, yondowo wuna bindisa mfumu mpaka, kana vumina mpe ntumunu yi Nzambi ko. Yobobo bana lembolo vumina ntumunu beyoyo, basosidi nsembolo mu yawu bende. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Mu dyambu ti, yobobo bakwe hidikanga misamu mimbote, balendi yena mimfundisi bunkuta ko. Kansi bakwe hidikanga misamu mimbi, yawu bafweti yena bunkuta. Tiidi mulembolo yena mfumu bunkuta e? Buna hidika misamu mimbote, na mbo wutambula masiika mandi. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Mu dyambu ti, mumfundisi kisadi ki Nzambi kidi mu dyambu di bumbote bwaku. Tala ti hidikidi misamu mimbi, yena bwabu bunkuta. Ka mu mpamba ko kasimbidi sabala ha kooko. Mu dyambu ti Nzambi kana sadila, mu lonka mankesi ku muntu wuna sadila mambi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Ni hahoho, budi bumbote mu tumimina zimfumu, ka mu dyambu di mankesi ma Nzambi kaka ko, kansi mu dyambu di mayindu mambote.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Bwabobo lukwe futilanga mpe mpaku. Mu dyambu ti, mimfundisi bisadi bi Nzambi bidi mu kisalu bekyokyo mpe. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Vutuleeno ku kadi muntu kyo ki kalusompisa: mpaku ku yondowo kwe futisanga mpaku, ntalu yi bazenga ku yondowo wu zenga yo, kivumi ku yondowo wu bafweti vumina, masiika ku yondowo wu bafweti siika.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luzolo mu mfinangani aku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Lubandi na mfuka na muntu ko. Mfuka yimosi kwandi yii neeno, ni mu zolasana yeno na yeno. Mu dyambu ti yondowo tiidi munandi, lungisi Musiku. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Mu dyambu ti, mina ni emi: «Kusadilandi bunsuza ko, kuhondandi ko, kuyibandi ko, kuzininandi ko.» Mpe mina mihiika mikangamani mu Mambu ema ti: «Zola mfinangani aku bonso ngebende<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wunzole wu Mose 20.13-17</char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Luzolo lukwe hidikanga mimbi ku munaku ko. Luzolo ni kima kikwe lungisanga Musiku.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuba wukubama mu nyizulu yi Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Luzebi bwabu mu nkye ntangu tudi. Ntangu yifweni ye temona, mu dyambu ti mpulusu yeka bela-bela neto, keka mu ntangu yi tutonina mu kwikila mu Klisto. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Mpimpa yeka kukula, bwisi bwe kya. Tuloseeno bwabu nsadulu zi kitombe, na tulwateeno binwanunu bye nwanina mu mwini. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Tudyatileeno mu ludedomo bonso bu tukwe dyatilanga mu mwini. Tubikeeno kindyafu, kinduvu, busafu, kindumba, mayuma na kimpala. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Kansi lwateeno Mfumu Yesu-Klisto, mpe lusandi mayindu mu nsuni ko mu yukutisa nzinunu zandi.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Kufundisandi mpangi aku ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Tambuleeno yondowo wuu lebakana mu kiminu, lubindisandi mabanza mandi mpaka ko. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Kuu na muntu wuu na kiminu mu dya bima bimvimba, kuu na wuhiika wuu wulebakana mu kiminu, yandi bikola byandi kakwe dyanga. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Yondowo kwe dyanga bimvimba, kayinandi yondowo kwe lembolo bye dyanga, mpe yondowo kwe lembolo bye dyanga, kafundisandi yondowo kwe dyanga byo, mu dyambu ti Nzambi yandi katambudi. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Ngeye nani wudi mu fundisa kisadi kingana e? Ni kaaba wukwikama hoti ni kabwa, myo mfumu andi mitadidi. Waaba wukwikama, mu dyambu ti, Mfumu wuu na lulendo mu musyamisa.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Kuu na muntu lendi banza ti, kuu na bilumbu bihyokidi mfunu na bihiika, wuhiika ti bilumbu bimvimba mfunu bidi. Kadi muntu kasa kiminu mu mbanzulu andi . <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Yondowo kwe yenanga bilumbu mfunu, kwe sanga bo mu zitisa Mfumu. Yondowo kwe dyanga bimvimba, kwe dyanga mu zitisa Mfumu, mu dyambu ti Nzambi kakwe vutudilanga matondo mu bindya. Yondowo kwe lembolo dyanga bimvimba kwe sanga bo mu vutula matondo ku Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Kadi kunaani muntu kwe zinganga mu dyambu di yandi bende, mpe kunaani muntu kwe fwanga mu dyambu di yandi bende. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Tala ti bamoyo tudi, mu nkumbu yi Mfumu tudi bamoyo, mpe tala ti bafwa tudi, mu nkumbu yi Mfumu tukwe fwilanga. Ni tu ba bamoyo, ni tu ba bafwa, bamvimba Mfumu wu tuvwidi. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Mu dyambu ti Klisto wufwa na wufuluka mu bafwa, mwanki kaba Mfumu yi bafwa na bamoyo. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Bwabu ngeye, mu dyambu di nki wuna fundisila mpangi aku e? Hoti ngeye, mu dyambu di nki wuna yinina mpangi aku e? Yeto bamvimba twaafundusu ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Mu dyambu wusonama ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">Meno wumoyo nidi, Mfumu teedi bo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">Bantu bamvimba baafukama ha ntadisi ani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">mpe ndinga zimvimba zina kembila Nzambi.<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Ni hahoho, kadi muntu waahaana mvutu ku Nzambi mu mimvimba mi kahidikidi.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubwisandi mpangi aku ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Tubikeeno mu kifundisa yeto na yeto. Kansi, sadileeno madyela meeno mulembolo tesisa mpangi aku sakuba, hoti mu mubwisa. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Mu Mfumu Yesu, nzebi mpe nina kwikila ti, kunaani kima kilembolo ba kivedila mu kyabende, kansi tala ti muntu teedi ti kii kivedila ko, buna kii kivedila ko mu yandi bende. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Tala ti mu dyambu di bindya, wuna yenisa munaku kyadi, zaba ti wuna dyatila dyaka mu luzolo ko. Mu dyambu di bindya byaku, keba kwaku mu zezisa kiminu ki yondowo Yesu wu kafwila. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Misamu mina yenika mimbote ku yeno, mibandi ku bahiika hwahwa di bakwe lusehidi. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Mu dyambu ti mu kimfumu ki Nzambi, ka kudya na kunwa ko, kansi lunungu, kiyenge na kyese kikwe haananga Mpeve Yilongo. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Yondowo wuna sadila Klisto mu nsalulu beyoyo, wuna yangidika Nzambi na wuna tambula masiika ku bantu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Ni hahoho, tusoseeno misamu mikwe twalanga kiyenge na mikwe kudisanga kiminu kyeto mu kintwadi. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Kubwisandi kisalu ki Nzambi mu dyambu di kudya ko. Tuzebi ti bima bimvimba bivedila bidi, kansi kambote ko mu sa ti kudya kutesisa masakuba. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Bumbote mu lembolo dya mbizi yi kibulu, mu lembolo nwa vinu na mu bika bimvimba bikwe bwisanga mpangi aku. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Kiminu kyo kii naku, toma keba kyo ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. Kyese ku yondowo kwe lembolo kibedisanga yandi bende mu myo mi kana hidika. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Kansi yondowo wuu na maketiketi mu dya, tala ti didi, wu kibedisi. Mu dyambu ti, ndyatulu andi yina kwelana ko na dyambu ditadidi kiminu. Misamu mimvimba mikwe lembolo dedakananga na kiminu, masumu madi.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yangidika munaku, kansi ka ngebende ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Yeto tuu na kiminu kikwikama, tufweti vibidila lebakani di yobobo balembolo ba na kyo, mpe tusoosandi mu kiyangidika yeto bende ko. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Kadi muntu fweti soosa kaka mu yangidika munandi mu bumbote bwandi, mwanki ka musadisa kakula mu kiminu. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Klisto kasoosa mu kiyangidika yandi bende ko, kansi bonso bu wusonama ti: «Bituku bi yobobo bakutukidi, bimbwididi.» <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Mu dyambu ti, misamu mimvimba bemyomyo misonama mu ntama, misonoko mu tuhaana ndongosolo, mwanki mu mvibudulu na nsyamusunu yikwe haananga Masonama, tuba na kivuvu. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Bika Nzambi yi mvibudulu na yi nsyamusunu katunga kintwadi ha kati dyeno bonso buu luzolo lu Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />Mwanki mu mutima wumosi na mu ndinga yimosi, lukembila Nzambi, Tata di Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Klisto, kisadi ki bantu bamvimba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Ni hahoho, kitambuleeno yeno na yeno bonso Klisto bu kalutambula, mu dyambu di nkembo wu Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Kedika nina ta ti Klisto wuyiza kituka kisadi ki bantu bazengoso bubakala mu lonka kikedika ki Nzambi, mpe mu lungisa nsilulu zi kasa ku zinkaka zawu, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />ku balembolo ba Bayudayo, bakembila Nzambi mu dyambu di nkenda zandi bonso buu wusonama ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">«Ni hahoho, naakukembila ha kati di balembolo ba Bayudayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">mpe naayimbila mu zangula nkumbu aku.»<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Wusonama dyaka ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">«Yeno lulembolo ba Bayudayo, yangalaleeno ha kimosi na mukangu andi!»<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Wubwesa sonama dyaka ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">«Yeno bamvimba lulembolo ba Bayudayo, kembileeno Mfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">na makanda mamvimba ma bantu ma mukembila!»<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Mumbikudi Yesaya wuta dyaka ti :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">«Muntu waatotoka mu nkuna yi Yese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">waatelama mu yaala balembolo ba Bayudayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">mpe mbo basa kivuvu kyawu mu yandi.»<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Bika Nzambi yikwe haananga kivuvu kalufulusa mu kyese na kiyenge mu dyambu di kiminu kyeno mu yandi, mwanki luba basempa mu kivuvu mu lulendo lu Mpeve Yilongo.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kisalu ki Pawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Mpangi zani, mu myo mi lutadidi, me bende nii na kiminu ti bafuluka ludi mu bumbote, mu madyela mamvimba, mpe luu na lulendo mu lwengasana yeno na yeno. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Mu ndambu zihiika zi mukanda ani, nalusonikina na vema kumvimba, mu lubambula moyo mu misamu mi luteka longoka. Nasonikina bobo mu dyambu di mulemvo wumpaana Nzambi, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />mu ba kisadi ki Yesu-Klisto ku balembolo ba Bayudayo. Nabyeko mu mwangisa Musamu Wumbote wu Nzambi, mwanki balembolo ba Bayudayo baba munkayulu waayangidika Nzambi, bazinga mu yandi mu nzila yi Mpeve Yilongo. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Meno bwabu nalendi kitumpidika mu Yesu-Klisto mu dyambu di kisalu ki Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Nakasonika ko tala ti ka misamu bemyomyo kwandi ko Klisto mi kalungisa mu meno bu kansadila mu twadisa balembolo ba Bayudayo mu lutumumu, mu mpova na mu nsadulu, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />mu lulendo lu bidimbu na bimangu na mu lulendo lu Mpeve yi Nzambi. Ni hahoho, kutonina ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi natee ku kizunga ki Ilili, nasamuna bubwingi mu ndambu ka ndambu Musamu Wumbote wu Klisto. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Kansi, nabindama mu kwe samuna Musamu Wumbote, mu bibuka kaka bi balembolo zonzila Klisto, mwanki nalembolo tunga mu lufulu lungana. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Mu dyambu ti wusonama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">« Ku yobobo kukalembolo samuna wo, baamuyena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">mpe ku yobobo balembolo yuwa wo, baabakula<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesaya 52.15</char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Makani ma Pawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Ni mamomo makwe sanga kikaku, mwanki nalembolo kwiza ku yeno. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Kansi bwabu, nsidi na kisalu mu bizunga bebibi ko. Tuuka mimvu mimingi, nii na mayindu mu kwiza luvunga, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />mpe bu naakwenda ku nsi yi Esipani, nii na kivuvu mu luyena bu nahyoka, na mu tambula lusadusu lweno mwanki nenda koko, ku manima me hyokisa mwa ntangu ha kimosi neeno. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Kansi bwabu, nenzi ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi mu sadisa balongo baa koko. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Mu dyambu ti, bantu ba bizunga bi Masedwani na Akayi, babongidi nzengolo ye yonzika minkayulu mye sadisila bamputu baa ha kati di balongo ba mbanza yi Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Bayeni ti bumbote budi, mpe mfuka yi yawu yiba nawu. Mu dyambu ti balembolo ba Bayudayo, bu batambula ndambu yi bimvwama bi kimpeve bi Bayudayo, yawu mpe bafweti basadisa mu mvwilu zawu. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Bu naatumbu manisa musamu bewuwu, na bu nabahaana minkayulu mi bayonzikidi, mbo naahyokila ku kweno mu kwenda ku nsi yi Esipani. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Nazebi ti, bu nina kwiza lu vunga, nina kwiza wufuluka mu lusakumunu lu Klisto.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Mpangi zani, nina lulomba mu nkumbu Mfumu eto, Yesu-Klisto na mu luzolo lu Mpeve Yilongo, lunwana ha kimosi naani bu luna sambila ku Nzambi mu dyambu dyani. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Sambileeno, mwanki nalembolo bwa mu moko ma bantu ba kizunga ki Yuda bakwe lembolo kwikilanga Klisto, mpe balongo ba mbanza yi Yelusalemi batambula bumbote lusadusu lu nina banatina. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Bwabobo naalendila mu kwiza wufuluka mu kyese ku yeno, tala ti Nzambi tiidi, mpe naabaka mwa ntangu ye huma ha kimosi neeno. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Bika Nzambi yi kiyenge kaba na yeno bamvimba! Ameni!<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote zi Pawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Nalutambikidi Fwebe kibusi kyeto, wudi mpe munkengi wu mukento mu dibundu di Senkeli. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Mutambuleeno mu nkumbu Mfumu, bonso bu bakwe zitisilanga balongo, musadiseeno mu misamu mimvimba mi kabela neeno nsatu. Mu dyambu ti, wusadisi bantu babingi na meno bende mpe.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Haaneeno mbote ku Pisika na Akilase, bakundi bani bakwe salanga naani mu kisalu ki Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Bakakihondisa mu vukisa luzingu lwani. Ka mehiika kaka ko nina bavutudila matondo, kansi mpe mabundu mamvimba ma balembolo ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Haaneeno mpe mbote ku dibundu dikwe kutakananga mu kati di nzo awu. Haaneeno mbote ku mukundi ani wuzola Epenete, muntu wuntete wukwikila mu Klisto mu kizunga ki Aziya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Haaneeno mbote ku Maliya wutoma sala bubwingi mu dyambu dyeto. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Haaneeno mbote ku Andonikuse na Yunyase bisi-kanda dyani na bakundi bani mu boloko. Zintumwa zi buzitu zidi, mpe bateka kwikila mu Klisto na meno.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Haaneeno mbote ku Ampyatuse wu natomini tya, mukundi ani wu natomini tya mu Mfumu. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Haaneeno mbote ku Yulubani mukundi ani wu kisalu mu Klisto, na ku Sitakise, mukundi ani wu natomini tya. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Haaneeno mbote ku Apelese lonkidi bidimbu bi kiminu kyandi mu Klisto. Haaneeno mbote ku yobobo baa mu nzo yi Alisitobule. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Haaneeno mbote ku Helodyoni mwisi-kanda dyani. Haaneeno mbote ku bantu baa mu nzo yi Nalisise bakwe kwikilanga mu Mfumu. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Haaneeno mbote ku Tilifene na Tilifose bakento bana toma sala bubwingi mu dyambu di Mfumu. Haaneeno mbote ku Peliside, mukundi ani wu mukento, wutomini sala bubwingi mu Mfumu. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Haaneeno mbote ku Lufuse wusoolo mu Mfumu, na ngudi andi wudi mpe ngudi ani. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Haaneeno mbote ku Asinklite, ku Felengoni, ku Helimese, ku Patolobase, ku Helimase na ku zimpangi zii kintwadi nawu. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Haaneeno mbote ku Filolonge, na ku Yuli, ku Nele na ku kibusi kyandi, ku Olimpase na ku bamvimba balongo badi kintwadi nawu.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Haanasaneeno mbote yi longo mu fibasana yeno na yeno. Mabundu mamvimba ma Klisto mbote malutambikidi.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukebisa kumanunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Mpangi zani, kebeeno kweno na yobobo bakwe kakidilanga ndongosolo yi lutambula bu bana lutwadila nkabani na bu bana soosa mu lubwisa. Beeno kitatu nawu. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Mu dyambu ti bantu babobobo, basadilanga Klisto Mfumu eto ko, kansi yawu myoyo myawu kwandi. Mu nzonzolo zawu zimbote na zi luvunu, bana huna bantu balembolo ba bakwikama mu kiminu. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Bwabu yeno, bantu bamvimba bazebi lutumumu lweno. Mpe kyese kii naani mu dyambu dyeno, kansi, ntiidi luba bantu bandwenga mu hidika misamu mimbote mpe bavedila mulembolo hidika misamu mimbi. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Mwa ntangu yifyoti kwandi yisiidi, Nzambi yi kiyenge waakosona Satana ku nsye bitambi byeno. Bika mulemvo wu Yesu-Klisto, Mfumu eto wuba neeno!<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timote, mpangi ani yi kisalu, mbote kana luhaana. Tambuleeno mpe mbote yi Lusyuse, yi Yasoni na yi Sosipatele, bisi-kanda dyani.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Mbote nina luhaana mu nkumbu yi Mfumu, meno Tetyuse wubalomba mu sonika mukanda bewuwu.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Ngayusi wuntambudi, mpe dibundu dimvimba dikwe kutakananga ku nzo andi, mbote dilutambikidi. Elasite, yandi wu kikebi ki mbongo zi mbanza na Kalituse mpangi eto, mbote balutambikidi.<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />[ Bika Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto kalusakumuna yeno bamvimba! Ameni ]<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bika Nzambi kakemboso</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Nzambi lendi lusyamisa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:25">bonso budi Musamu Wumbote wu nina samuna na malongi ma nina longa mu Yesu-Klisto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:25">yandi wudi mansweki mayenikini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:25">maba maswama tuka mimvu ka mimvu.<verse eid="ROM 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Kansi bwabu makani bemomo mayenikini ku bantu ba nsi zimvimba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:26">mu nzila yi masonama ma mimbikudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:26">bonso budi ntumunu yi Nzambi yi mimvu ka mimvu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:26">mwanki basa kiminu kyawu mu yandi mpe bamutumimina.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Ku Nzambi kaka wuu na ndwenga zimvimba, bika katambula nkembo yi mimvu ka mimvu, mu nzila yi Yesu-Klisto!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:27">Ameni!<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>